            do not coincide (which they must to be a standard natural transformation). I’ll call it something else then. How about “sheet transformations”?
          %blockquote
            %h2#definition_2 Definition
            %p
              Given categories
              = succeed "," do
                %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
